<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<h1>About Wine Words</h1>
<p class="lede">A general tasting profile for future wine data.</p>
<section>
  <p>
    The finder starts with broad sensory parameters: acidity, body, tannin,
    sweetness, alcohol warmth, and fruit intensity. Those values are stored per
    wine style, grape, producer, region, or bottle as the library grows into a
    database-backed project.
  </p>
  <p>
    Use the <%= link_to "Finder", finder_path %> to identify likely styles from
    taste, or the <%= link_to "Tasting Quiz", quiz_path %> to test your palate
    against a stored wine profile.
  </p>
  <p>
    <%= link_to "Back to wine list", wines_path, class: "back-link" %>
  </p>
</section>